{"classified_as":[{"_id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300033799","label":"oil paintings (visual works)","type":"Type"},{"_id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300033618","label":"paintings (visual works)","type":"Type"},{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/object/8402","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"repository number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404621"}],"content":"8402","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"catalogue raisonnée number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026061"}],"content":"287","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"non-preferred identifiers","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300264273"}],"content":"287, Catalogue Raisonné","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"Red \u0026 Orange Streak/Streak","type":"Name"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"non-preferred identifiers","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300264273"}],"content":{"alternate-title":{"titles":[{"notes":"Source of title: Philadelphia Museum of Art.","title":"Red and Orange Streak","type":"alternate-title"}],"type":"alternate-title"},"alternate-title-1999-catalogue-raisonne":{"titles":[{"notes":"Source of title: Whitney Archive.","title":"Orange \u0026 Red","type":"alternate-title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"},{"notes":"Source of title: Whitney Archive.","title":"Yellow and Red","type":"alternate-title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"},{"notes":"Source of title: Whitney Archive.","title":"Red Yellow and Black Streak","type":"alternate-title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"},{"notes":"Source of title: Downtown Gallery Archive.","title":"Orange and Red Streak","type":"alternate-title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"},{"notes":"Source of title: Abiquiú Notebooks.","title":"No. 46 Orange and Red Streak","type":"alternate-title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"}],"type":"alternate-title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"},"selected-exhibition-titles":{"titles":["Orange and Red Streak\nO'Keeffe and Texas, 1998, McNay Art Museum (San Antonio)"],"type":"selected-exhibition-titles"},"title-1999-catalogue-raisonne":{"titles":[{"notes":"Source of title: backing inscriptions, 1, 3.","title":"Red \u0026 Orange Streak/Streak","type":"title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"}],"type":"title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"}},"type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"Georgia O'Keeffe","id":"actor/2","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Measurement Description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/measurement_description"}],"content":"27 x 23 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"A bright red, yellow, and orange form arches from the upper right to the lower left of the composition. The shape contrasts with a dark, landscape-like background in shades of black and dark green. On the upper third of the composition, a horizontal strip of vibrant red, resembling a mountain range, spans the width of the canvas.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"provenance_narrative","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/provenance_narrative"}],"content":"In the artist's collection; The Georgia O'Keeffe Estate, 1986; bequest to PMA, 1987 \n(Source: Philadelphia Museum of Art, 2025)","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"credit line","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026687"}],"content":"Bequest of Georgia O'Keeffe for the Alfred Stieglitz Collection, 1987","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Medium and Dimensions","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_medium_dims"}],"content":"Oil on canvas, 27 x 23 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Holding Institution","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_instituion"}],"content":"Philadelphia Museum of Art","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Complete","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_complete"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe. Red \u0026 Orange Streak/Streak, 1919. Oil on canvas, 27 x 23 inches. Philadelphia Museum of Art. Bequest of Georgia O'Keeffe for the Alfred Stieglitz Collection, 1987. © Georgia O'Keeffe Museum","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Materials description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/materials_description"}],"content":"Oil on canvas","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Artist(s)","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_artist"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Title and Date","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_title_date"}],"content":"Red \u0026 Orange Streak/Streak, 1919","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Copyright","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_copyright"}],"content":"© Georgia O'Keeffe Museum","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"cr_remarks_1999","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/cr_remarks_1999"}],"content":["Whitney Archive, Abiquiú Notebooks indicate, \"Exam. at Amer. Place, March 1946.... On backing: Written by O'Keeffe, title and date as above [Red Yellow and Black Streak]\" [not verified]. Whitney Archive, Downtown Gallery Archive date 1922.  Abiquiú Notebooks dates 1919 and indicates, \"Incorrectly classified as 1922.\" Pictured in 1923 New York (Anderson) and 1935 New York (An American Place) Stieglitz installation photographs, see Appendix III, figures 15, 58. O'Keeffe wrote: \"*From the Plains* [see cat. no. 288] and *Orange and Red Streak* were painted in New York months after I left that wide world [Texas]. The cattle in the pens lowing for the calves day and night was a sound that has always haunted me. It had a regular rhythmic beat like the old Penitente songs, repeating the same rhythms over and over all through the day and night. It was loud and raw under the stars in that wide empty country\" (*Georgia O'Keeffe* [1976], unpaginated text accompanying entry 3). (Source: Lynes, 1999)"],"type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[{"digitally_shown_by":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/857721/full/full/0/default.jpg","type":"DigitalObject"}],"classified_as":[{"_label":"Digital Image","id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300215302","type":"Type"}],"digitally_available_via":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/857721"}],"conforms_to":[{"id":"http://iiif.io/api/image","type":"InformationObject"}],"format":"application/ld+json;profile='http://iiif.io/api/image/2/context.json'","type":"DigitalService"}],"type":"DigitalObject"}],"type":"VisualItem"}],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}